Derivation
----------
This font is a DERIVATIVE WORK of:

    "Macedonian cursive script" by MacedonianBoy (Wikimedia Commons)
    https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Macedonian_cursive_script.svg
    Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported (CC BY-SA 3.0).

The Macedonian cursive letterforms were vectorized (traced) from that chart. The
digits, the punctuation, the Bold weight, the full Latin alphabet, and all spacing /
kerning / engineering are additions by Goran Arsov. Changes were made to the original
material.

